WEBVTT

00:06:27.996 --> 00:06:32.663
And we lit the camp at night with
a little paraffin lamps,

00:06:33.663 --> 00:06:35.204
kerosene lamps and call them,

00:06:35.204 --> 00:06:43.829
I think Will Mike took this chance
experience with a can and he developed it.

00:06:43.829 --> 00:06:46.871
So in the end he learned to keep
three counts ahead of him

00:06:47.288 --> 00:06:51.579
and would charge towards males who
were his superiors at the time.

00:06:51.871 --> 00:06:56.538
And it was a scary thing to have three
cans hurtling towards you making this

00:06:56.871 --> 00:07:00.788
noise. So they got out of the
way and then, you know,